    rdfs:label "Benzothiadiazoles" ;
    ns2:IAO_0000115 "Heterocyclic aromatic compounds containing a benzene ring fused to a thiadiazole ring. Thiadiazole is a five-membered aromatic heterocycle made up of one sulfur atom and two nitrogen atoms." ;
